  "id": "cue-exposure",
  "term": "cue exposure",
  "definition": "Cue exposure is a conditioning-based treatment approach in which a person is repeatedly exposed to alcohol-related cues or settings without actually drinking alcohol. It is intended to reduce cue-triggered craving and some bodily reactions linked to those cues.",
